hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1784","[AI-translation] Mominon ki maan Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par Makkah mein naazil hui jabke main khelney wali ladki thi: (Balke Qiyaamat unka waada hai aur Qiyaamat zyada sakht aur kadwi hai). (Bukhari: 4876). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aur un donon key siwa do jannatein hain)."
